1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,294
From a warm lump of radioactive plutonium.

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:06,953
No turbine, no engine, no moving parts at all.

3
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:17,252
The heat flows out through rows of junctions between two different materials, and wherever there is a temperature difference across such a junction, a voltage appears.

